      "message": "fix(app): refuse cut recipes with saved start or exit picks\n\nA contour's links.approach.start_point and exit_point are source\ncoordinates. ApplyCutRecipe now refuses them by recipe name, like the\nother saved geometry. Pinned by command and MCP tests for each field.\n\nRefs #3073\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
